  m_Text: "Blue lifts its gaze, dwelling in the west,\nOnly the heavens embrace it
    best.\n\nYellow and orange march side by side,\nAbove the red flame, their glow
    is wide.\n\nRed burns alone, far from green\u2019s embrace,\nHolding the west
    in a solemn place."
